@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### List all Git repositories
GET {{baseUrl}}/azure/repositories
Accept: application/json

###

### List active pull requests (default top=10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/azure/pull-requests
Accept: application/json

###

### List pull requests filtered by status and count
GET {{baseUrl}}/azure/pull-requests?status=active&top=5
Accept: application/json

###

### List pull requests filtered by repository
GET {{baseUrl}}/azure/pull-requests?repositoryId=REPO_ID_HERE&status=active&top=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get pull request diff (change entries) by PR ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/azure/pull-requests/183922/diff
Accept: application/json

###

### Get full unified diff (actual file content changes) by PR ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/azure/pull-requests/1/full-diff
Accept: application/json

